**Notifications Macro** provides information about recent activities done by the users. [[Learn more>>https://extensions.xwiki.org/xwiki/bin/view/Extension/Notifications%20Application/#HNotificationsMacro]]

== Wiki Activity ==

{{example}}
{{velocity}}
{{notifications count="5" useUserPreferences="false" displayOwnEvents="true" wikis="$services.wiki.currentWikiId"/}}
{{/velocity}}
{{/example}}

== Current User Activity ==

{{example}}
{{velocity}}
{{notifications count="5" useUserPreferences="false" displayOwnEvents="true" users="$xcontext.user"/}}
{{/velocity}}
{{/example}}
